    "detailed_description": "Part One: Camoflux Origins<br>You, <i>The Other</i>, adapt to changing conditions using vibrational terraforming, camouflage, &amp; electromagnetic sensors. Explore neo-primordial worlds, solve environmental puzzles, &amp; alter relationships with bosses in this third person ontology. <br><br>*Features*<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897980/extras/a10d630d0b5aa023d8269faa4a38a8ad.poster.avif?t=1726509483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897980/extras/a10d630d0b5aa023d8269faa4a38a8ad.webm?t=1726509483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897980/extras/a10d630d0b5aa023d8269faa4a38a8ad.mp4?t=1726509483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>- Solve surreal environmental puzzles and glide through interconnected landscapes to forge your path in constantly-shifting terrains where all lands, entities, and technology share sentience.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897980/extras/2513f5549d7c43e86f457cd4a2c30150.poster.avif?t=1726509483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897980/extras/2513f5549d7c43e86f457cd4a2c30150.webm?t=1726509483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897980/extras/2513f5549d7c43e86f457cd4a2c30150.mp4?t=1726509483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>- Unique battle system where you can choose between destroying bosses or dynamically engaging with adversarial beings.  <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897980/extras/78ed3d626f795938e3522fb5a04a0523.poster.avif?t=1726509483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897980/extras/78ed3d626f795938e3522fb5a04a0523.webm?t=1726509483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897980/extras/78ed3d626f795938e3522fb5a04a0523.mp4?t=1726509483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>- Customize your character through camouflage and discover your neo-primordial expression by switching embodiments. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897980/extras/Mangrove-Boss-Reveal-3-better-lit.gif?t=1726509483\" /></div><br><br>- Adventure through hand-crafted worlds that meld traditional fine arts methods, combining Romantic and Surrealist painting, Virtual Reality sculpting, and multimedia artworks with Unreal Engine 5.<br><br>- Evolve your abilities with the release of each episodic chapter. Playtime approximately 1-2 hrs per chapter.",
    "about_the_game": "Part One: Camoflux Origins<br>You, <i>The Other</i>, adapt to changing conditions using vibrational terraforming, camouflage, &amp; electromagnetic sensors. Explore neo-primordial worlds, solve environmental puzzles, &amp; alter relationships with bosses in this third person ontology. <br><br>*Features*<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897980/extras/a10d630d0b5aa023d8269faa4a38a8ad.poster.avif?t=1726509483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897980/extras/a10d630d0b5aa023d8269faa4a38a8ad.webm?t=1726509483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897980/extras/a10d630d0b5aa023d8269faa4a38a8ad.mp4?t=1726509483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>- Solve surreal environmental puzzles and glide through interconnected landscapes to forge your path in constantly-shifting terrains where all lands, entities, and technology share sentience.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897980/extras/2513f5549d7c43e86f457cd4a2c30150.poster.avif?t=1726509483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897980/extras/2513f5549d7c43e86f457cd4a2c30150.webm?t=1726509483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897980/extras/2513f5549d7c43e86f457cd4a2c30150.mp4?t=1726509483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>- Unique battle system where you can choose between destroying bosses or dynamically engaging with adversarial beings.  <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897980/extras/78ed3d626f795938e3522fb5a04a0523.poster.avif?t=1726509483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897980/extras/78ed3d626f795938e3522fb5a04a0523.webm?t=1726509483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897980/extras/78ed3d626f795938e3522fb5a04a0523.mp4?t=1726509483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>- Customize your character through camouflage and discover your neo-primordial expression by switching embodiments. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897980/extras/Mangrove-Boss-Reveal-3-better-lit.gif?t=1726509483\" /></div><br><br>- Adventure through hand-crafted worlds that meld traditional fine arts methods, combining Romantic and Surrealist painting, Virtual Reality sculpting, and multimedia artworks with Unreal Engine 5.<br><br>- Evolve your abilities with the release of each episodic chapter. Playtime approximately 1-2 hrs per chapter.",
    "short_description": "Camoflux is a hand-painted episodic exploration game where landscapes, bodies, and technology fuse. Camouflage and channel circuits of environmental energy to alter primordial conflicts and reshape a cyclical cataclysm.",
